---
description: Publish DBI Leader Dashboard edits to GitHub Pages
alwaysApply: true
---

After changing this DBI Leader Dashboard repo, commit and push to the branch GitHub Pages publishes (origin main) so https://nelurs.github.io/dbi-leader-dashboard/ updates. Do not leave dashboard edits only on disk.

Do this only when the user asked for the change, or when they asked for the public page to stay current. Never force-push. Never update git config. Never commit secrets.
